# Checker-verified pages are byte-exact by contract: the scripts in notes/scripts/ regex on
# `*"…"` quotation markers, on `| n |` table cells with no cell padding, and on block-quote line
# positions. Prettier 3.9.9 rewrites all three (720 `*x*` -> `_x_`, 244 `*"…"` -> `_"…"`, 2,043
# padded table lines over notes/) and its markdown printer exposes only proseWrap and singleQuote,
# so none of it is configurable. Format only the four pages no checker parses, listed below.
# notes/scripts/README.md is excluded for the same reason: its checker's needles match unpadded
# table cells and `**N**` counts verbatim, and its mutant set asserts those needles fire.
notes/*.md
notes/scripts/**/*.md
notes/summaries/**/*.md
!notes/conjecture-standing.md
!notes/links.md
!notes/proof-density.md
!notes/summaries-workflow.md

